      </div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="under">
        <p class="quiz-question">4. The rug is below the table. The rug is ___ the table.</p>
        <div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="under">under</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="on">on</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="next to">next to</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="kitchen">
        <p class="quiz-question">5. Which room usually has a stove and a refrigerator?</p>
        <div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="kitchen">kitchen</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="bedroom">bedroom</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="bathroom">bathroom</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="hallway">hallway</button></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="bedroom">
        <p class="quiz-question">6. You usually find a bed and a closet in the ___.</p>
